IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- S 485/2016 (Rg 3), an amending instrument that the e-Gazette supplied and IMDA's list of the Telecommunications Act's subsidiary legislation does not include.
-- Read in full on 2026-11-04 (the Gazette copy is deposited beside the other Rg 3 texts).  Rg 3 is the class-licence regulations, and S 485/2016 only
-- deletes a definition of "Authority" from its regulation 2.  It is encoded as a dated function so that every row of the coverage table is accounted for.

§ `Rg 3 as amended by S 485/2016 (deemed in operation 1 October 2016)`

-- Regulation 2 of Rg 3 in the 2002 Revised Edition lists "class licence", "Facilities-Based Operator", "licensee", "operator" and "Services-Based Operator"
-- and no "Authority" (TA1999-RG3:52-70); S 685/2011 inserted "Authority" from 28 December 2011 (src below in sgta-i-rg3-amendments.l4); S 485/2016 deletes it.
-- Before 1 January 2003 the text is not deposited (NOTES.md Fork B).
-- S 485/2016 is RETROSPECTIVE: first published 3 October 2016 at 5.00 pm (TA1999-RG3-S485-2016.txt:3), deemed in operation on 1 October 2016.  The function takes both days,
-- the conduct day and the reading day, as sgta-i-versions.l4 does for N 1, Rg 5 and Rg 6: the answer is the version with the latest published day among those published on
-- or before the reading day whose effective day is on or before the conduct day.  The three rows are the 2002 Revised Edition (no "Authority"; start and publication day assumed
-- 1 January 2003, Fork B), S 685/2011 (published 27 December 2011, in operation 28 December 2011) and S 485/2016.
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:21 | 1. These Regulations are the Telecommunications (Class
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:22 | Licences) (Amendment) Regulations 2016 and are deemed to have
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:23 | come into operation on 1 October 2016.
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:25 | Amendment of regulation 2
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:26 | 2. Regulation 2 of the Telecommunications (Class Licences)
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:27 | Regulations (Rg 3) is amended by deleting the definition of
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:28 | “Authority”.
@ref Rg 3 reg 2 as amended by S 485/2016 (src:TA1999-RG3-S485-2016:21-28)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 3 reg 2: the regulation defines "Authority" for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 3 10 2016)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 10 2016)) THEN JUST FALSE  -- S 485/2016
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 27 12 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 28 12 2011)) THEN JUST TRUE  -- S 685/2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) THEN JUST FALSE  -- 2002 Revised Edition
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
